  "bodyHash": "d95775a86900f3d0",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">《Mutant Monsters》将 Minecraft 的生物挑战提升至全新的恐怖高度！与标志性生物的变异体展开激战，每种变异体都拥有毁灭性的力量与独特的奖励。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">击败变异僵尸、变异骷髅、变异苦力怕、变异末影人等，每一种都将带来全新的挑战。制作强力道具，驯服爆炸性的小兵，并发现如“蜘蛛猪”这般奇异的新生物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在这个生存并非理所当然的世界里，准备好迎接史诗般的战斗与传奇般的战利品吧！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💥 特色变异体</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧟‍♂️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">变异僵尸</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：体型庞大的蛮力怪物，拥有强力的砸击攻击。击败它可获得强力武器</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">浩克锤</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">变异骷髅</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：致命的神射手。击败它后可用其骨骼制作</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">变异骷髅铠甲</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">变异苦力怕</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：以连环爆炸制造混乱。死亡后会掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕小兵蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">变异末影人</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：令人恐惧的瞬移杀手。斩断其手臂，即可通过</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">末魂之手</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">获得它的力量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">☃️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">变异雪人傀儡</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：强大的盟友，会向敌人投掷巨大的冰块。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">👾 小兵与伙伴</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕小兵</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：从</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕小兵蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">中孵化出的爆炸性盟友。使用</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕追踪器</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">驯服并追踪它们。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🕷️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">蜘蛛猪</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一种快速且难以预测的生物，由对吃过发酵蛛眼的猪使用</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">化学药剂X</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">制造而成。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧪 特殊物品</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛠️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">化学药剂X</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一种神秘液体，可将生物突变为强大的变异体或奇异的新生物。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">浩克锤</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一把强力武器，砸向地面时可击退敌人。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧤 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">末魂之手</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：从变异末影人处获得瞬移与方块操控能力。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕碎片</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一种剧毒武器，作用于地形时会引发爆炸。通过摧毁</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕小兵蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">获得。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧬 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">苦力怕追踪器</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：用于追踪和控制你的苦力怕小兵的装置。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">变异骷髅铠甲</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：使用</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">变异骷髅骨骼</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">制作强力护甲。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客户端与服务端均需安装</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Puzzles Lib</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（适用于 Fabric & NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Fabric API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（适用于 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安装 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config API Port</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（适用于 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若模组支持配置，可通过游戏内模组菜单直接进行设置（在 Fabric 端需要安装 Prospector 开发的</span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。请注意，在较旧的 Minecraft 版本中，还需要安装</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若需使用外部文本编辑器进行手动配置，所有文件均位于</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">目录下，文件名分别为</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，具体取决于配置文件类型。并非所有类型的配置文件都会存在，甚至可能完全没有。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">衷心感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shcott21\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Shcott21</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，早在多年前他就最初发布了本模组《</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-creatures-mod\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mutant Creatures</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">》。绝大部分的工作，尤其是那些惊人的模型，均由他完成。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/chumbanotz\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Chumbanotz</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，他率先通过《</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mutant-beasts\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mutant Beasts</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">》模组将变异生物带入现代 Minecraft，为本次最终复兴奠定了基础。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">非常感谢 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tdstress\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">tdstress</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">全面重制了模组中的所有贴图，使其契合新的 Minecraft 美术风格！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/echo-chest\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/echochest/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/effect-descriptions\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectdescriptions/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dyed-flames\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/dyedflames/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/mutantmonsters/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
